{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44692","headline":"赠王仙柯 · 中寤","name":"赠王仙柯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瞻思不及望仙兄，早晚昇霞入太清。\n手种一株松未老，炉烧九转药新成。\n心中已得黄庭术，头上应无白发生。\n异日却归华表语，待教凡俗普闻名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"中寤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}